<title>FRANCE: France to sell new 5-yr BTAN at Feb 20 auction.</title>
<headline>France to sell new 5-yr BTAN at Feb 20 auction.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>France plans to sell a new five-year benchmark government bond, a 4.75 percent March 12, 2002 BTAN, for the first time at its February 20 auction, the Treasury said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Treasury also said in a statement it would be selling the existing 4.75 percent April 12, 1999 and 5.5 percent October 12, 2001 BTANs at its January 16 auction.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
